{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──將安潔接回家。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早上被她叫醒、和她一起上學，我的生活理所當然地出現了許多變化……", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是對我來說，最大的變化或許是這個。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0961", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，現在是出門上學前的一小段空檔。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔不在，客廳裡只有我和櫻乃兩人。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥哥？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0962", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，沒事。」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔來我們家之後，櫻乃即使和我兩人獨處也不再叫我「葛格」了。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我當然不會做出當面詢問她這種不識趣的事情。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感覺得出來這是櫻乃用她自己的方式做出了區隔，我也該認真地面對。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的主要身分已經不是「櫻乃的葛格」，而是「安潔的主人」了……", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，抱歉，只是在發呆。」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「戀愛腦？」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0963", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想說說看不習慣的詞。」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0964", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈。」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過不管怎麼說，我還是很感激櫻乃能用正面的態度去接受我們家的變化。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我覺得自己必須更可靠一點才行。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不說這個。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。應該說，已經發生了。只是忘記說。」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0965", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天去了銀行，看到這次的匯來的金額比以前都還要多。」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0966", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「生活費？」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0967", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以就打了電話問。」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0968", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯……然後呢？」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說是給哥哥的賀禮。」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0969", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的臉熱了起來。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只是櫻乃，連爸媽都……", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也要打通電話才行。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥的害羞真難得一見。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0970", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃輕描淡寫地說，喝完了杯中的茶。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我越來越體會到自己能走到今天，都是多虧了身邊人的幫助。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊呀啊、居然有賀禮……」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1899", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔好期待和大主人、大夫人見面的那一天……」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1900", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得他們應該也很期待。」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我打算今天晚上打電話給爸媽，安潔要不要也講幾句話？」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的！請務必讓安潔講電話，安潔也要向他們道謝！」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1901", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……有些緊張呢，主人。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1902", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，有嗎？」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有喔。」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1903", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔越來越覺得身邊的大家都在關照著我們……」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1904", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──安潔本身也出現了許多變化。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她基本上是個活潑開朗的女孩，不過最近常常能感受到她成熟穩重的言行舉止。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "類似沉穩……的感覺吧？還有最明顯的是散發出了「女性魅力」這樣的氣氛。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只是這樣。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……對了，主人。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1905", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……♪」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1906", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔拉了拉我的袖子，溫柔地整理我的制服。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人的這邊總是立刻就皺起來了。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1907", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，這樣啊……抱歉抱歉，謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會，安潔也是開始燙主人的衣服後才發現的。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1908", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今後每天都會為您整理衣著的，呵呵，請放心吧。」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1909", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……謝謝。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "照顧我時的眼神、表情和動作，果然和之前有點不一樣了。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真正意義上的越來越像女僕……是嗎？", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1910", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──有種年輕太太的感覺。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎麼說，雖然害羞但我還是很開心的。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺安潔越來越綻放出原本的樣子了。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好甜蜜喔，你們兩個～♪」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0346", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔喔嚇我一跳！」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，還是吐槽了……明明我都這麼努力裝沒看見了……」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4044", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、欸！」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1911", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該該該不會很引人注目嗎愛理同學！？」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1912", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「全校最引人注目的就是你們。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "sn0362", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「默默等他們自己結束就好了，真是的……」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4045", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，哈哈哈，這種狀況就是要鬧一下才有趣吧～」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0347", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊唔唔……」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1913", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來我們的對話都被大家看在眼裡了……", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，事到如今也沒辦法……是說瓜生君你沒注意到嗎？」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4046", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～欸……不好意思……」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「整個鬆懈了呢，瓜生新吾以前的樣子。」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4047", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "無話可說。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過我可以像這樣放鬆，完全都是多虧（？）了安潔。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼……唔呼呼呼……」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1914", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人整個人都放鬆了，呀哈真是的，安潔沒有比這更幸福的事了～～！」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1915", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「痛！好痛！住手住手！我聽不懂妳在說什麼幸不幸福啦！」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "sn0363", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔顯然對我的改變非常高興。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她高興就好。所以我也沒有什麼意見。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，安潔的微妙變化大家顯然都看得出來。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我去一下學生會。」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或許可能有事要拜託安潔，所以妳可以在這邊等我嗎？」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，遵命！」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1916", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請代替安潔向會長問好，主人。」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1917", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那我走了。」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學和隼太同學也慢走，安潔的主人就拜託兩位了。」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1918", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦好啦，就這樣吧。」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0348", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在安潔的目送之下，我們三人前往學生會。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，是為了不久前開始運作的組織改善委員會的事。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "基本上現在已經擬出了改善的草案，管理學校方面委託安潔的工作。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像這樣介入讓命令系統明確、統整壓在安潔身上的資料，藉此改善整個組織的感覺。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思，明明是我叫你們來的。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……剛才那樣的確很難打擾呢。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4048", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為小瀨名很容易害羞嘛。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0349", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「揍你喔！」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4049", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是希望變成這樣才幫助你的。如果打擾的話就本末倒置了。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4050", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……萬分感謝。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然很感謝他們，不過也因此讓羞恥的程度加倍了。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4051", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔已經完全展現出自己了呢。」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4052", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是嗎？」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已經不再怯縮，天真爛漫的女僕。」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4053", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈哈，變成像天羽學姊那樣嗎？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0350", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺不太相同……嗯～該怎麼說呢。」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4054", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「人妻感。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0351", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是這個！」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4055", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以從旁邊看著都莫名不好意思了起來……不過也好啦，這樣也好啦……」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4056", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呃。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我雖然害臊，但還是回應了她的話。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得那是安潔的『女僕』這一面喔。嗯……現在才終於漸漸地……」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4057", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是誇張的情侶。」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4058", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哈哈。」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0352", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……既然有新婚感就表示已經做了嗎？」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0353", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;「唔！」", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "「唔！」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂喂，就算再怎麼在意也不能問得那麼直接啦！」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4059", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨、瀨名同學也很在意啊……」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔。」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4060", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因、因為你們住在一起不是嗎！？當然會在意了，畢竟安潔那個模樣！」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4061", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個……」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒想到比起我們當事人，身邊的人更在意「那件事」啊……", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過這也表示在大家眼中，我們進展得很順利吧……", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，是秘密。」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也、也是啦，你保密就好了。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4062", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少女心還真是複雜呢～」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "ht0354", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男生這麼單純真好呢。」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 472, "voice": "ar4063", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……也難怪他們會在意，畢竟那件事的確很重要。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或許差不多要認真考慮了……", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔。」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0971", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯嗯。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0972", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯嗯？」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃……？」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我猜不出她想說什麼，於是跟著來到走廊。櫻乃打開她的房門，往裡面看。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔。」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0973", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是的……已經照妳說的在房間裡喊了幾聲……」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1919", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔剛才在櫻乃的房間裡。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是什麼意思呢？？？」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1920", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0974", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥的房間聽不到。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0975", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我在考慮要不要把房間搬到一樓，不過如果是在哥哥的房間發生的話，好像就沒問題。」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0976", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼欸？」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1921", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，請不必客氣。」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0977", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會……櫻乃？」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、主、主人！」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1922", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0978", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是在擔心明明感情很好，但遲遲沒有「做了」的跡象的我們……？", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要不把耳朵貼在我房間的門板上就不會聽到，所以請便的感覺……", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等一下等一下等一下妳想太多了！」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有點罪惡感。」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0979", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是那個意思，不是那個意思啦！」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、欸！？怎怎怎麼回事呢！？」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1923", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小姑其實也會在意很多事。」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 486, "voice": "sk0980", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就說不是了！」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊～請不要丟下安潔逕自討論啦～」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1924", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
